  "description": "The end of the day is calling – and you answer with full throttle. The PATH RIOT CF Full Party is the light-assist e-MTB for anyone who wants to turn their local mountain into a bike park. The lightweight Fazua Ride 60 drivetrain delivers exactly the power you need to quickly reach the trailhead – without throwing you off your flow. Then, on the downhills, it's party on! A 160mm RockShox fork, 140mm shock, SRAM drivetrain, DT Swiss wheels – no expense has been spared, just smart specs. The Full Party setup delivers high-end components where they count. And discreetly refrains from anything superfluous. For those who know what they need – and what they don't.",
